First held on December 2, 2010, we usually run this workshop early in December each year.

===2013 Workshop===
Activities
*Soap molding
*Mold making
*Woven wrapping paper
*Pop up cards
*Paper wallets
*Fridge magnets
*Shopping bags
*Santa hats
*Purses
*Open ended making:
**If you see some materials you want to work with and have an idea, then we'll try to help you craft your project!
**If you feel like bringing your own materials to include into any of the above crafts, or any crafts you would like to do, we can incorporate that somehow as well.

